{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ancient Rome - DLC Models Package</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC package unlocks a variety of 3D models inspired by Ancient Rome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Roman Buildings<br>-Modular Assets<br>-Roman Soldiers and Characters<br>-Monuments and Objects<br>-and of course...Roads!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577640/extras/Roman_Gif.gif?t=1741863504\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer Compatibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a Game Master using this package, your players can view your maps online even if they don't own it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This package is <strong><u>included</u></strong> in the Wrath of Devs Expansion. If you have backed that campaign, then you do not need to purchase this.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577640?t=1741863504","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577640/d05e3dd5b592203c99b955b56d62c0ef746a687d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741863504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577640/98d2071d4012f9d38b8e1c0f8aea87223cd04487/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741863504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577640/98d2071d4012f9d38b8e1c0f8aea87223cd04487/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741863504","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"